     "Arrange in pairs: (x⁴) | (−10x³y + 27x²y²) | (−10xy³ + y⁴).",
     "The square root of the first term x⁴ is x².",
     "Subtract (x²)² = x⁴; the remainder is 0. Bring down the next pair: −10x³y + 27x²y².",
     "Double the root x²: 2x². The next term of the root is −5xy, since 2x² × (−5xy) = −10x³y.",
     "Subtract (2x² − 5xy)(−5xy) = −10x³y + 25x²y²; the remainder is 2x²y². Bring down the next pair: −10xy³ + y⁴.",
     "Double the root x² − 5xy: 2x² − 10xy. The next term of the root is y², since (2x² − 10xy)y² = 2x²y² − 10xy³.",
     "Subtract (2x² − 10xy + y²)y² = 2x²y² − 10xy³ + y⁴; the remainder is 0.",
